and the selected result runs an exact two-sided Mann-Whitney U test on the 12 leaf records (6 vs 6), so repeated measurements from the same plant were entered into a row-independent procedure as if independent, driving U = 35.0 and p = 0.004329 from inflated per-arm sample sizes.\",\"A lock was minted and its unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone: authorized_key_columns [\\\"plant_id\\\"] equals the declared independent-unit column, tied to data/input.csv and the scipy.stats.mannwhitneyu procedure record, and its stated limitations claim no execution or numerical correctness, so the demonstrated dependence issue does not break the key derivation.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["Declared unit column plant_id matches the frozen data: PL-01..PL-06 each appear exactly twice (lower and upper leaf), amendment is constant within each plant, and both arms (biochar and control) contain 3 plants contributing 6 leaf rows each, as declared.","The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states each leaf record was entered as one observation, its summary table shows 6 leaf records from only 3 plants per arm, and the selected result runs an exact two-sided Mann-Whitney U test on the 12 leaf records (6 vs 6), so repeated measurements from the same plant were entered into a row-independent procedure as if independent, driving U = 35.0 and p = 0.004329 from inflated per-arm sample sizes.","A lock was minted and its unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone: authorized_key_columns [\"plant_id\"] equals the declared independent-unit column, tied to data/input.csv and the scipy.stats.mannwhitneyu procedure record, and its stated limitations claim no execution or numerical correctness, so the demonstrated dependence issue does not break the key derivation."]},"ttft_ms":7623,"ttft_stream_ms":1612,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duratio